        "buildJavaScript": "You are helping a beginner student learning arrays in JavaScript.\n\nWrite simple JavaScript code that displays the total number of items and the last item from an array using existing variables.\n\nDisplay the total count using document.getElementById(\"count\") and the last item using document.getElementById(\"lastItem\").\n\nDo not modify the array. Do not create new variables. Do not use loops or advanced syntax.\n\nReturn only valid JavaScript code. No explanation."
